> User Rhonda3839 (283419)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68241,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"90e6d4e1c3d38f9adc52cf33531f33ff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies, been lurking and surfing the site for a few weeks now and thought I&#039;de say hello!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My names Jackie and my fiance and I after 10 years together have decided to finally \"make it legal\"!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We cruised once about 5 years ago and loved it and have decided we don&#039;t really want the big fanfare of a big wedding since we both have been married before. Having a holiday and getting married at the same time sounded like a fabulous idea. After doing some searching on destinations I came across some wedding photography done on St Thomas and fell in love with it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Cruise leave Miami May 5th and stops on May 8th on St Thomas, our wedding day!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hoping to connect with some other cruise\/St Thomas brides to bounce ideas with!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1635821,"PostDate":1340827145,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies, been lurking and surfing the site for a few weeks now and thought I'de say hello!<\/p> <p> My names Jackie and my fiance and I after 10 years together have decided to finally \"make it legal\"!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We cruised once about 5 years ago and loved it and have decided we don't really want the big fanfare of a big wedding since we both have been married before. Having a holiday and getting married at the same time sounded like a fabulous idea. After doing some searching on destinations I came across some wedding photography done on St Thomas and fell in love with it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Cruise leave Miami May 5th and stops on May 8th on St Thomas, our wedding day!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hoping to connect with some other cruise\/St Thomas brides to bounce ideas with!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaxie001@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338131655,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255894.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jackie Milton","Id":255894,"Name":"Jackie Milton","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68241,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2336dbead69242a5f2478471ede5d9b","RawContent":"Congrats on your engagement! Happy planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1636787,"PostDate":1341085297,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats on your engagement! Happy planning!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Elizabeth_ann_hills@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1335989515,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254865.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lizrmt","Id":254865,"Name":"Lizrmt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68241,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a67dd3e6f451a1e494b01aa71e20442","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats Jackie + welcome aboard the forum - all the best with your exciting plans :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1657694,"PostDate":1346189572,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats Jackie + welcome aboard the forum - all the best with your exciting plans <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.61.172.96","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68241,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d6e44bb8f81937cc554448fa5eb875c3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey Jackie! Congratulations!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m planning a destination wedding in St Thomas in June 2015; As of right now I&#039;m leaning towards Island Bliss.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Which beach did you get married on? which wedding planner did you use?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Did you have a reception on the beach\/nearby restaurant or back on the ship?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you,&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1838241,"PostDate":1394837873,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Jackie! Congratulations!<\/p>\n<p>I'm planning a destination wedding in St Thomas in June 2015; As of right now I'm leaning towards Island Bliss.<\/p>\n<p>Which beach did you get married on? which wedding planner did you use?<\/p>\n<p>Did you have a reception on the beach\/nearby restaurant or back on the ship?<\/p>\n<p>Thank you,<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"atwater7@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.240.19.233","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389467519,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"LADYJUSTICE","Id":276017,"Name":"LADYJUSTICE","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.243.13.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":68241,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0efc1a3847aade1e3147ef1c531bb096","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats! &amp;nbsp;I got engaged in St, Thomas in December 2012. &amp;nbsp;What a gorgeous island!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1841747,"PostDate":1396306981,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats! \u00a0I got engaged in St, Thomas in December 2012. \u00a0What a gorgeous island!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jacqueline.gilgannon@rci.rogers.com","IpAddress":"24.114.255.7","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393867339,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"gannonham","Id":276978,"Name":"gannonham","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
