Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.117.202.27","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a8c8c98d6b39e33e6aca48edc47cf33","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi All!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am planning our destination wedding for May 6, 2014... exactly 4 months from today! Also, we will be having our reception party back home here in Cape May, NJ. I know that it seems crazy, but I do not have anything confirmed yet. Our flights &amp;amp; hotel is booked, but that is about it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I feel like I basically started truly planning today. If anyone has any tips for planning in such a short time frame I would appreciate any help I can get!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am so happy I stumbled onto this site!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-Morgan&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1823519,"PostDate":1389051243,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi All!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am planning our destination wedding for May 6, 2014... exactly 4 months from today! Also, we will be having our reception party back home here in Cape May, NJ. I know that it seems crazy, but I do not have anything confirmed yet. Our flights & hotel is booked, but that is about it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I feel like I basically started truly planning today. If anyone has any tips for planning in such a short time frame I would appreciate any help I can get!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am so happy I stumbled onto this site!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-Morgan\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"beachgirlm1@comcast.net","IpAddress":"174.57.217.43","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388679065,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275840.jpg?_r=1389064603","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nursemorgan","Id":275840,"Name":"nursemorgan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46f0124ac90f56a25cf1c8fc9ca25664","RawContent":"[quote name=\"nursemorgan\" post=\"1823519\" timestamp=\"1389065643\"]\nHi All! \n\nI am planning our destination wedding for May 6, 2014... exactly 4 months from today! Also, we will be having our reception party back home here in Cape May, NJ. I know that it seems crazy, but I do not have anything confirmed yet. Our flights &amp;amp; hotel is booked, but that is about it!\n\nI feel like I basically started truly planning today. If anyone has any tips for planning in such a short time frame I would appreciate any help I can get!\n\nI am so happy I stumbled onto this site! \n\n-Morgan  :)[\/quote]Hello Nursemorgan,\nCongrats on your Nuptial and welcome on BDW, As wedding Planner in the Riviera Maya, I can tell you 4 months can work you just have to put your focus glove on.\n\nIf you are just Eloping then finding a hotel that does Elopement is great, if not then some the private locations in the Riviera Maya which we are happy to recommend where we can help with just the minister and photographer and flowers for and anything extra you may need.\n\nIf you are planning a smaller group wedding then:\n\n1.Start your Planning by choosing a location, and secure it. decide on your theme\/ colors\n2. Send out invitations not necessary to do STD with only 4 months to go.\n3. Search and then book your photographer and DJ\n4. Book your hair and make up\n5. focus on any extra entertainment such mariach , trio for the ceremony etc.\n6. Decide on wedding favors \n8. pick your flowers and decor. wedding cake\n9 Timeline and celebrations","Attachments":[],"Id":1823556,"PostDate":1389056728,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>nursemorgan, on 06 January 2014 - 11:34 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi All!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am planning our destination wedding for May 6, 2014... exactly 4 months from today! Also, we will be having our reception party back home here in Cape May, NJ. I know that it seems crazy, but I do not have anything confirmed yet. Our flights & hotel is booked, but that is about it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I feel like I basically started truly planning today. If anyone has any tips for planning in such a short time frame I would appreciate any help I can get!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am so happy I stumbled onto this site!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-Morgan\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hello Nursemorgan,<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on your Nuptial and welcome on BDW, As wedding Planner in the Riviera Maya, I can tell you 4 months can work you just have to put your focus glove on.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you are just Eloping then finding a hotel that does Elopement is great, if not then some the private locations in the Riviera Maya which we are happy to recommend where we can help with just the minister and photographer and flowers for and anything extra you may need.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you are planning a smaller group wedding then:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1.Start your Planning by choosing a location, and secure it. decide on your theme\/ colors<\/p>\n<p>2. Send out invitations not necessary to do STD with only 4 months to go.<\/p>\n<p>3. Search and then book your photographer and DJ<\/p>\n<p>4. Book your hair and make up<\/p>\n<p>5. focus on any extra entertainment such mariach , trio for the ceremony etc.<\/p>\n<p>6. Decide on wedding favors\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>8. pick your flowers and decor. wedding cake<\/p>\n<p>9 Timeline and celebrations<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a5d2ff5c8e014c5e5b66e20f7fc42d6b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;It will work, but it is going to take some focus. &amp;nbsp;It also depends on how \":big\" of a wedding you are doing.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Best wishes and congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1823595,"PostDate":1389087680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It will work, but it is going to take some focus. \u00a0It also depends on how \":big\" of a wedding you are doing.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Best wishes and congrats!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trbutleress@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1384961990,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275203.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trbutler","Id":275203,"Name":"trbutler","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.144.5.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09431e41904528a6a1f01dd2d84ed1ea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"nursemorgan\"] Picking a location and date at this time is going to be very challenging, good luck! I booked my date a year in advance and the dates were completely filled up in a month! You might need to be flexible with the time of the ceremony! That will definitely help you find availability on your date!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1823777,"PostDate":1389115638,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275840\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/275840-nursemorgan\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">nursemorgan<\/span><\/a> Picking a location and date at this time is going to be very challenging, good luck! I booked my date a year in advance and the dates were completely filled up in a month! You might need to be flexible with the time of the ceremony! That will definitely help you find availability on your date!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kacielking@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.239.247.54","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1379611942,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273614.png?_r=1408114193","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kbride2014","Id":273614,"Name":"kbride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.57.85.80","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a202853aef738ded4032c73b6b968c4b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ahh good luck! I&#039;m not getting married til August an I feel like I have a bunch to do. Happy planning&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1823829,"PostDate":1389121871,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ahh good luck! I'm not getting married til August an I feel like I have a bunch to do. Happy planning<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kwolcott82314@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.57.85.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1386879182,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275606.jpg?_r=1386893736","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KWitt","Id":275606,"Name":"KWitt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.92.9.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"889f6f3c6c1fa1154e75bef640cd6008","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You can definitely pull a wedding together in four months, it just takes a lot of planning. I would say you can begin by contacting resorts to see their availability. Since you are starting pretty late,&amp;nbsp; you might not have many options with times. But I think you can definitely accomplish your wedding. Happy Planning!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1825308,"PostDate":1389544837,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You can definitely pull a wedding together in four months, it just takes a lot of planning. I would say you can begin by contacting resorts to see their availability. Since you are starting pretty late,\u00a0 you might not have many options with times. But I think you can definitely accomplish your wedding. Happy Planning!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);\">Tiarra <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);\">February 14th 2015 *A celebration of Love* <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);\">Isla Mujeres<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"><em>\"And now abide faith, hope, love, these three; but the greatest of these <i>is<\/i> love.\"<\/em><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"tiarrajones0913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.92.9.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365416634,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268317.jpg?_r=1387755717","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TiarraBeautyJ","Id":268317,"Name":"TiarraBeautyJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.117.202.27","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56f2ee2c267014b5ce5936b0e60290f8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"dreamweddings\"] @[member=\"trbutler\"] @[member=\"kking\"] @[member=\"KWitt\"] @TiarraBeautyJ&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We now have:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;a ceremony location: Trunk Bay St John USVI&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;we are staying at the marriott in st thomas&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;our post ceremony dinner &amp;amp; beach party will be at havana blue (they had our date open!!! OMG!)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have a dress&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;our flights are booked&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Still waiting on invitations and to get our groomsmen attire...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Unfortunately for me I started on the fun DIY stuff first. FAIL. I do have my welcome bags almost complete as well!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1825465,"PostDate":1389589693,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"250090\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/250090-dreamweddings\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">dreamweddings<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275203\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/275203-trbutler\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">trbutler<\/span><\/a> @kking @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275606\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/275606-kwitt\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KWitt<\/span><\/a> @TiarraBeautyJ\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We now have:<\/p>\n<p>a ceremony location: Trunk Bay St John USVI<\/p>\n<p>we are staying at the marriott in st thomas<\/p>\n<p>our post ceremony dinner & beach party will be at havana blue (they had our date open!!! OMG!)<\/p>\n<p>I have a dress<\/p>\n<p>our flights are booked<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Still waiting on invitations and to get our groomsmen attire...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Unfortunately for me I started on the fun DIY stuff first. FAIL. I do have my welcome bags almost complete as well!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"beachgirlm1@comcast.net","IpAddress":"174.57.217.43","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388679065,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275840.jpg?_r=1389064603","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nursemorgan","Id":275840,"Name":"nursemorgan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"182.182.74.230","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7746a83f54d5dd454ed72dd87563f07","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;best of luck for your children planning noe&amp;nbsp; hahahaa&amp;nbsp; :P :wub:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1825471,"PostDate":1389602295,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>best of luck for your children planning noe\u00a0 hahahaa\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.durranifarms.com\/'>Mango exporter in Pakistan<\/a>","Email":"zubairgexton71@gmail.com","IpAddress":"182.180.187.47","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389319096,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"gexton71","Id":275979,"Name":"gexton71","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.219","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa7aec1243974afb25bdaa01575e478d","RawContent":"Its all  coming together. .congrats! \n\nSent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1825832,"PostDate":1389673763,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Its all  coming together. .congrats! <br><br>Sent from my SGH-I337M using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda_l32@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"50.70.106.17","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382048639,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274348.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amandab36","Id":274348,"Name":"amandab36","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.180.48.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5bb496573e00c39f9a704f11a3094e8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey Morgan!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;   I am basically trying to book the same thing except we are looking at May 9th and 10th... Couple of quick questions... how are you getting your guests from Marriott to the Ceremony location? and where did you book your ceremony though? Thanks :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1826043,"PostDate":1389731257,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Morgan!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0 I am basically trying to book the same thing except we are looking at May 9th and 10th... Couple of quick questions... how are you getting your guests from Marriott to the Ceremony location? and where did you book your ceremony though? Thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimhaskins19@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.202.186.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1387796571,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MiNole19","Id":275719,"Name":"MiNole19","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":20,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
