PostDate":1390228200,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaclynwalsh@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.157.37.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1389818975,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276121.jpg?_r=1391065312","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jwalsh","Id":276121,"Name":"jwalsh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.51.180.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"19f9e86f676c45cae73c405e24b01c4d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!! Sounds like you have the big things in place at least...dress, venue all booked. The DIY stuff is the fun part :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1827734,"PostDate":1390302161,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Happy planning!! Sounds like you have the big things in place at least...dress, venue all booked. The DIY stuff is the fun part <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nightskyfadingred@gmail.com","IpAddress":"209.51.180.59","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1377687932,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272996.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pandahugs","Id":272996,"Name":"pandahugs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.112.128.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"37bc58a7ab4694d4469ac88637f5bc41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum, Morgan, and Congrats on your May Wedding coming right up!!! it&#039;s great to see your relaxed style and how much you&#039;ve already accomplished - well done!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think it&#039;s a good indication that you&#039;re going the right way, when things have a way of falling into place so easily :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy the rest of your planning and all the best on your Wonderful Wedding Day.......cheers!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t1\/1469974_10151997423589487_1239644599_n.jpg\" alt=\"1469974_10151997423589487_1239644599_n.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1827855,"PostDate":1390325659,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum, Morgan, and Congrats on your May Wedding coming right up!!! it's great to see your relaxed style and how much you've already accomplished - well done!<\/p>\n<p>I think it's a good indication that you're going the right way, when things have a way of falling into place so easily <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>Enjoy the rest of your planning and all the best on your Wonderful Wedding Day.......cheers!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t1\/1469974_10151997423589487_1239644599_n.jpg\" alt=\"1469974_10151997423589487_1239644599_n.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"156.34.167.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47d767d013f3c6aabc230507bfa2e371","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats! &amp;nbsp;If it makes you feel any better, I&#039;ve been booked for over a year but have barely done any planning! &amp;nbsp;And my wedding is 3 months from tomorrow....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1828308,"PostDate":1390440893,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats! \u00a0If it makes you feel any better, I've been booked for over a year but have barely done any planning! \u00a0And my wedding is 3 months from tomorrow....<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laurawells03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"156.34.167.73","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1390440466,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nurselaura","Id":276284,"Name":"nurselaura","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.248.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"521a4ae7cb7fac785376da138d37cee8","RawContent":"Good luck!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using &lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/tapatalk.com\/m?id=1\"&gt;Tapatalk&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1829111,"PostDate":1390827894,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Good luck!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using <a href='http:\/\/tapatalk.com\/m?id=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Tapatalk<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rvalenka@gmail.com","IpAddress":"166.137.12.120","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383890954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274900.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rvalenka","Id":274900,"Name":"rvalenka","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.175.107.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c5b8784f04079408db1be6888c56a715","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations!&amp;nbsp; You can definitely get it done in that time....the tips already posted are great.&amp;nbsp; Happy planning!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1831074,"PostDate":1391274524,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations!\u00a0 You can definitely get it done in that time....the tips already posted are great.\u00a0 Happy planning!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.baio330@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.104.228.158","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369649057,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269996.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amy330","Id":269996,"Name":"amy330","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.117.202.27","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ca7f2131319bb5d0c6d76d5ae5f0a8e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MiNole19\"] Hi! We are still trying to figure out our transportation for the day of our ceremony. There is a public ferry that goes back and forth between st thomas and st john, but we are considering getting a private boat for transportation the day of! I will keep you posted!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\nJanelle from Island Bliss Weddings has been a Godsend. She is getting our ceremony details together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Where are you getting married? And where are you staying?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"nurselaura\"] oh my! good luck with everything! I feel like a year can go by so so fast!! :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1835578,"PostDate":1393343414,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275719\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/275719-minole19\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MiNole19<\/span><\/a> Hi! We are still trying to figure out our transportation for the day of our ceremony. There is a public ferry that goes back and forth between st thomas and st john, but we are considering getting a private boat for transportation the day of! I will keep you posted!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\nJanelle from Island Bliss Weddings has been a Godsend. She is getting our ceremony details together.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Where are you getting married? And where are you staying?\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276284\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276284-nurselaura\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">nurselaura<\/span><\/a> oh my! good luck with everything! I feel like a year can go by so so fast!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"beachgirlm1@comcast.net","IpAddress":"174.57.217.43","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388679065,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275840.jpg?_r=1389064603","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nursemorgan","Id":275840,"Name":"nursemorgan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.148.79.60","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3e49798fa129267a6bd39e6013cec6b1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats! It sounds like you&#039;re well on your way! Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1835632,"PostDate":1393365475,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats! It sounds like you're well on your way! Happy planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.103.74.40","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2016bff44b153009336bd5a052dd7001","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am in the same boat. We are planning in getting married in July 5 or 6th, 2014. Have chosen a hotel but haven&#039;t put a deposit down. I have signed up with destinationweddings.com, paid the $50 initial fee, received their room agreement letter and guess what??? They are charging me additional $25 per person for Independence day (July 3, 4, 5).&amp;nbsp; :o&amp;nbsp;!! Can you believe that?!? Now, I can understand if I was traveling around the US .... but we are going to Mexico! It&#039;s not their Independence day! Has anyone heard of this?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1835786,"PostDate":1393471247,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am in the same boat. We are planning in getting married in July 5 or 6th, 2014. Have chosen a hotel but haven't put a deposit down. I have signed up with destinationweddings.com, paid the $50 initial fee, received their room agreement letter and guess what??? They are charging me additional $25 per person for Independence day (July 3, 4, 5).\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>\u00a0!! Can you believe that?!? Now, I can understand if I was traveling around the US .... but we are going to Mexico! It's not their Independence day! Has anyone heard of this?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gmgnubla@msn.com","IpAddress":"23.24.208.251","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1392150172,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JGCwedding","Id":276641,"Name":"JGCwedding","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":20,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
