739444fd8bd","RawContent":"my wc highly recommends ej and i trust her judgement. His pricing is also fairly in line with other photogs.\n \n Good Luck","Attachments":[],"Id":758929,"PostDate":1247583661,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                my wc highly recommends ej and i trust her judgement. His pricing is also fairly in line with other photogs.<br \/> <br \/> Good Luck\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mslisalgarrett@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1229616247,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213252.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"blacksred","Id":213252,"Name":"blacksred","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":39143,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35ae36b1cd1a92ac90f84c767f471919","RawContent":"I was ab to post a question on this. We are booked with Blue Glass but I was also thinking ab changing to Kelly O. my concern was the price. We are gonna be paying $800 for 2 hrs. Does that seem like too much? In looking at other photographers it seems like that price is low but in my mind I think that&#039;s ludicrous. Also we&#039;d be paying the same price with both photographers...","Attachments":[],"Id":762642,"PostDate":1247770520,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I was ab to post a question on this. We are booked with Blue Glass but I was also thinking ab changing to Kelly O. my concern was the price. We are gonna be paying $800 for 2 hrs. Does that seem like too much? In looking at other photographers it seems like that price is low but in my mind I think that's ludicrous. Also we'd be paying the same price with both photographers...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Be Blessed,<br>Mrs. Willis<br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com\">MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/zz72\/Prettyhazardous\/087WillisWedding.jpg\">http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...lisWedding.jpg<\/a><\/strong><\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyfleming05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1229832699,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213287.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Prettyhazardous","Id":213287,"Name":"Prettyhazardous","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":39143,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7dc98f1e68288aa4f46b73b8f622e4ff","RawContent":"I&#039;d recommend Eric Johnson based on his portfolio :) \n \n Also Blue Glass has a few different photog&#039;s, I remember reading a review that wasn&#039;t 100% favorable for one of the photographers","Attachments":[],"Id":762700,"PostDate":1247772202,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'd recommend Eric Johnson based on his portfolio <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br \/> <br \/> Also Blue Glass has a few different photog's, I remember reading a review that wasn't 100% favorable for one of the photographers\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>I have a fabulous photographer I can share in the United States Virgin Islands in late April\/early MayP.M. if interested!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/goppvbh7hxc5u.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/tick...pvbh7hxc5u.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cjmcdowell16@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1241916601,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217403.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":33,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CrystalM","Id":217403,"Name":"CrystalM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":39143,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3194e9454946e318529619ed1ee5899c","RawContent":"I&#039;ve heard lots of good things about EJ...but I LOVE Kelly O&#039;s portfolio. Not too many review on her though...\n All the wedding planners I&#039;ve spoken with have recommended and used both of them.\n $800 isn&#039;t too bad if you get ALL the originals (100+ shots). Prints are normally always extra.\n The reviews seem to be hit and miss with Blue Grass...and I wasn&#039;t too big a fan of their portfolio, but they are also very highly recommend.","Attachments":[],"Id":765421,"PostDate":1247951079,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've heard lots of good things about EJ...but I LOVE Kelly O's portfolio. Not too many review on her though...<br \/> All the wedding planners I've spoken with have recommended and used both of them.<br \/> $800 isn't too bad if you get ALL the originals (100+ shots). Prints are normally always extra.<br \/> The reviews seem to be hit and miss with Blue Grass...and I wasn't too big a fan of their portfolio, but they are also very highly recommend.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;116\/st\/20100503\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/8e16\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...8e16\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tkruidbos@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1247338663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219329.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FatCracker","Id":219329,"Name":"FatCracker","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":39143,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57d0d905e4eada884b2944a9170a8cd2","RawContent":"I agree ab Blue Glass, it seems that they are good based on which photographer you get. My WC reassured me on Blueglass so we&#039;re gonna stick with them and do the 2 hrs for $800. I think we get originals but I&#039;m not 100% sure I will ask my WC...","Attachments":[],"Id":765588,"PostDate":1247971917,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I agree ab Blue Glass, it seems that they are good based on which photographer you get. My WC reassured me on Blueglass so we're gonna stick with them and do the 2 hrs for $800. I think we get originals but I'm not 100% sure I will ask my WC...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Be Blessed,<br>Mrs. Willis<br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com\">MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/zz72\/Prettyhazardous\/087WillisWedding.jpg\">http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...lisWedding.jpg<\/a><\/strong><\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyfleming05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1229832699,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213287.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Prettyhazardous","Id":213287,"Name":"Prettyhazardous","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":39143,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e91d2e6c15024ae62bf2a687e4007149","RawContent":"We booked the wedding!! \n \n I read reviews, and contacted both photographers. Kelly O recommended our wc and the photo package they offered, so we just upgraded. Our wc said Kelly is one of the photographers they use regularly, so they have the package at a lower rate. But I do have to pay extra for the CD. \n \n Thanks for the input ladies...8 )\n Good luck and happy planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":782850,"PostDate":1249015287,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We booked the wedding!! <br \/> <br \/> I read reviews, and contacted both photographers. Kelly O recommended our wc and the photo package they offered, so we just upgraded. Our wc said Kelly is one of the photographers they use regularly, so they have the package at a lower rate. But I do have to pay extra for the CD. <br \/> <br \/> Thanks for the input ladies...8 )<br \/> Good luck and happy planning!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;116\/st\/20100503\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/8e16\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...8e16\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tkruidbos@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1247338663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219329.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FatCracker","Id":219329,"Name":"FatCracker","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":39143,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"80c5c25f110f33b22e5b9f9569322156","RawContent":"Eric Johnson is definitely the best. Check out his website at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.paradisepictures.vi\"&gt;St. Thomas, St. John, Virgin Islands, Caribbean Wedding Photography by photographer Eric Johnson&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":916054,"PostDate":1257629779,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Eric Johnson is definitely the best. Check out his website at <a href='http:\/\/www.paradisepictures.vi' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>St. Thomas, St. John, Virgin Islands, Caribbean Wedding Photography by photographer Eric Johnson<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashlee52282@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1253374786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"VirginIslandGirl","Id":221794,"Name":"VirginIslandGirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":39143,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e2bd35d79b230ff2e2a4558f915f44b","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;FatCracker&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;We booked the wedding!! \n \n I read reviews, and contacted both photographers. Kelly O recommended our wc and the photo package they offered, so we just upgraded. Our wc said Kelly is one of the photographers they use regularly, so they have the package at a lower rate. But I do have to pay extra for the CD. \n \n Thanks for the input ladies...8 )\n Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n I&#039;m curious to know who your WC is. Please share.","Attachments":[],"Id":1044791,"PostDate":1266792648,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>FatCracker<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">We booked the wedding!! <br \/> <br \/> I read reviews, and contacted both photographers. Kelly O recommended our wc and the photo package they offered, so we just upgraded. Our wc said Kelly is one of the photographers they use regularly, so they have the package at a lower rate. But I do have to pay extra for the CD. <br \/> <br \/> Thanks for the input ladies...8 )<br \/> Good luck and happy planning!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> I'm curious to know who your WC is. Please share.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashlee52282@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1253374786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221794.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"VirginIslandGirl","Id":221794,"Name":"VirginIslandGirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"39143","Title":"St. Thomas Photographers","LastPostDate":1389574265},"Pages":{"TotalItems":21,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
