Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":6,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":581,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1520383,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":241179,"Name":"trayj919","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241179.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1316104645,"LastPoster":{"Id":275840,"Name":"nursemorgan","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275840.jpg?_r=1389064603","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":25,"Preview":{"Id":1520383,"PostDate":1316104645,"PostContent":"Hi all!  \u00a0  My fiancee and I booked our date for Nov 6, 2012 at the Marriott =)\u00a0 We put a deposi...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tjavier919@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1308142464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241179.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trayj919","Id":241179,"Name":"trayj919","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63545,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a38862412aae7a00b607bc97cf5436a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi all!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My fiancee and I booked our date for Nov 6, 2012 at the Marriott =)&amp;nbsp; We put a deposit down to have the ceremony at the Seacliff Terrace but are now having second thoughts on whether the beach would be a better option - we&#039;ll see what happens!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My wedding coordinator at Marriott is Kaitlin and shes been pretty good so far.&amp;nbsp; She said Marriott uses Bluegrass Photography, High Definition Video, and Sugar&amp;amp; Spice for make up&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Has anyone used\/heard things about them?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; So far the only other thing we booked was a reception dinner at Havana Blue...debating on doing the buy out option! It all depends on the number of people coming!&amp;nbsp; Has anyone had their whole venue at the restaurant?&amp;nbsp; Do they accommodate space for dancing etc?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Looking forward to some feedback!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Tracy&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1520383,"PostDate":1316104645,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi all!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My fiancee and I booked our date for Nov 6, 2012 at the Marriott =)\u00a0 We put a deposit down to have the ceremony at the Seacliff Terrace but are now having second thoughts on whether the beach would be a better option - we'll see what happens!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My wedding coordinator at Marriott is Kaitlin and shes been pretty good so far.\u00a0 She said Marriott uses Bluegrass Photography, High Definition Video, and Sugar& Spice for make up<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Has anyone used\/heard things about them?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> So far the only other thing we booked was a reception dinner at Havana Blue...debating on doing the buy out option! It all depends on the number of people coming!\u00a0 Has anyone had their whole venue at the restaurant?\u00a0 Do they accommodate space for dancing etc?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Looking forward to some feedback!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Tracy<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tjavier919@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1308142464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241179.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trayj919","Id":241179,"Name":"trayj919","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63545,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21965a991983f083e3cbe9e9e1276f24","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Tracy,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m getting married at the Sugar Bay Resort &amp;amp; Spa in March and I&#039;m thinking of booking Sugar &amp;amp; Spice for hair and makeup.&amp;nbsp; I talked to a bride who recently used them and she had nothing but great things to say about them.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1521826,"PostDate":1316453488,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Tracy,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm getting married at the Sugar Bay Resort & Spa in March and I'm thinking of booking Sugar & Spice for hair and makeup.\u00a0 I talked to a bride who recently used them and she had nothing but great things to say about them.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k.renae25@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1296685889,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236309.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"krenae","Id":236309,"Name":"krenae","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63545,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d37f286fc8fbdbbb3d831230a1f05f36","RawContent":"We are getting married on march 26th. We are using Blue Glass photo. We have only heard great things about them. I&#039;m using sugar &amp; spice artistry. We are very excited. We are getting married on St. John, but I&#039;ve heard great things about Blue Havana.","Attachments":[],"Id":1581004,"PostDate":1328897813,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are getting married on march 26th. We are using Blue Glass photo. We have only heard great things about them. I'm using sugar & spice artistry. We are very excited. We are getting married on St. John, but I've heard great things about Blue Havana.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"msbaker@uhs.laca.org","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1328862719,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251237.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":145,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Seahorse32612","Id":251237,"Name":"Seahorse32612","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63545,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac773bbeffe14aa9c73852a5168b1d87","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just got married 3\/27\/12, and I used Sugar and Spice for my hair and makeup- they are awesome!&amp;nbsp; Definitely listened to everything I wanted, and they made it happen.&amp;nbsp; I would HIGHLY recommend them! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1603846,"PostDate":1333564051,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just got married 3\/27\/12, and I used Sugar and Spice for my hair and makeup- they are awesome!\u00a0 Definitely listened to everything I wanted, and they made it happen.\u00a0 I would HIGHLY recommend them! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mellojess83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305807112,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240183.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MelloJess83","Id":240183,"Name":"MelloJess83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.57.217.158","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63545,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"49736a8c9a273e32f7ffa69330a4d545","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"trayj919\"] The seacliff terrance looks beautiful! I am planning our wedding for st john on May 6, 2014 but we are staying at the marriott, so we will be doing our dinner at the marriott after our ceremony. Havana blue looks gorgeous and exactly like what we wanted. Did everything go okay for you? We would love to see pictures from your event space and if you have any advice or things you would change i would really appreciate it! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MelloJess83\"] Do you remember what Sugar &amp;amp; Spice charged for hair and make up if you dont mind?&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Seahorse32612\"] Where are you getting married in St John if you dont mind me asking?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1823969,"PostDate":1389141760,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"241179\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/241179-trayj919\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">trayj919<\/span><\/a> The seacliff terrance looks beautiful! I am planning our wedding for st john on May 6, 2014 but we are staying at the marriott, so we will be doing our dinner at the marriott after our ceremony. Havana blue looks gorgeous and exactly like what we wanted. Did everything go okay for you? We would love to see pictures from your event space and if you have any advice or things you would change i would really appreciate it! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"240183\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/240183-mellojess83\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MelloJess83<\/span><\/a> Do you remember what Sugar & Spice charged for hair and make up if you dont mind?<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"251237\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/251237-seahorse32612\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Seahorse32612<\/span><\/a> Where are you getting married in St John if you dont mind me asking?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"beachgirlm1@comcast.net","IpAddress":"174.57.217.43","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388679065,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275840.jpg?_r=1389064603","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nursemorgan","Id":275840,"Name":"nursemorgan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.117.202.27","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63545,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56f6d6ded5605275881f9d75e2a01317","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am just curious about Sugar &amp;amp; Spice makeup &amp;amp; hair. How were they and do you remember how much they charged? Also can they come directly to your room at the marriott?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1825248,"PostDate":1389531042,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am just curious about Sugar & Spice makeup & hair. How were they and do you remember how much they charged? Also can they come directly to your room at the marriott?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"beachgirlm1@comcast.net","IpAddress":"174.57.217.43","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388679065,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275840.jpg?_r=1389064603","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nursemorgan","Id":275840,"Name":"nursemorgan","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"63545","Title":"St. Thomas bride-to-be needs advice on photographer, videographer, and makeup\/hair stylist!!!","LastPostDate":1389531042},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"