{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":23,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":3572,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":373354,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":210322,"Name":"akittrell","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210322.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1215576576,"LastPoster":{"Id":275840,"Name":"nursemorgan","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275840.jpg?_r=1389064603","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":25,"Preview":{"Id":373354,"PostDate":1215576576,"PostContent":"I think we are leaning more towards the USVI for our weddingmoon, but I'm having a hard time find...","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png\">http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wUBKFOA\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...FOA\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><span>The below website is a great tool! It's really helped me in my quest to lose weight and live a healthier life!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg\">http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"alkittrell2@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215206899,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210322.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akittrell","Id":210322,"Name":"akittrell","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1794da53e1a7fd21f2258b21c818c22f","RawContent":"I think we are leaning more towards the USVI for our weddingmoon, but I&#039;m having a hard time finding many all inclusive resorts. So far, I&#039;ve found Bolongo Bay and Windham Bay Resort and that&#039;s it. I know there has to be more AI Resorts than these two.??\n \n We are considering the USVI over other places simply because we don&#039;t have to worry with obtaining passports or the extra expense for them. However, we aren&#039;t opposed to any other location except Mexico. We don&#039;t like the fact that their law requires your ceremony to be performed in Spanish.\n \n I&#039;m just really starting to stress. I feel like I&#039;m going in circles with my research because I keep hitting dead ends due to budgets or no availability issues. Our wedding is 6 months away and I&#039;ve accomplished NOTHING! It&#039;s not like I&#039;ve waited until the last minute either; my FI proposed two weeks ago. I started wedding planning the very next day. I don&#039;t know maybe I&#039;m expecting too much from this process, but I just thought I would have accomplished something in a two week time period. *sigh*\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/crybaby2.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Crybaby2\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":373354,"PostDate":1215576576,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think we are leaning more towards the USVI for our weddingmoon, but I'm having a hard time finding many all inclusive resorts. So far, I've found Bolongo Bay and Windham Bay Resort and that's it. I know there has to be more AI Resorts than these two.??<br \/> <br \/> We are considering the USVI over other places simply because we don't have to worry with obtaining passports or the extra expense for them. However, we aren't opposed to any other location except Mexico. We don't like the fact that their law requires your ceremony to be performed in Spanish.<br \/> <br \/> I'm just really starting to stress. I feel like I'm going in circles with my research because I keep hitting dead ends due to budgets or no availability issues. Our wedding is 6 months away and I've accomplished NOTHING! It's not like I've waited until the last minute either; my FI proposed two weeks ago. I started wedding planning the very next day. I don't know maybe I'm expecting too much from this process, but I just thought I would have accomplished something in a two week time period. *sigh*<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/crybaby2.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Crybaby2\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png\">http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wUBKFOA\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...FOA\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><span>The below website is a great tool! It's really helped me in my quest to lose weight and live a healthier life!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg\">http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"alkittrell2@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215206899,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210322.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akittrell","Id":210322,"Name":"akittrell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"07a73a51b3ea9838ca055878bf097d55","RawContent":"I wanted USVI for the same reasons as you and those are the only 2 AI I found as well.\n \n I quickly turned to Mexico because I love Mexico. We immediately applied for passports as well as our guests and we all got them in 1-2 weeks. Also, I planned our wedding in 6 months. Mexico has SO many great AI&#039;s , you may want to give it shot. \n First, pick what area and then start emailing the resort to see what dates they have available. I just got married under 2 weeks ago at Dreams Tulum and it was perfect! Hope this helps.","Attachments":[],"Id":373359,"PostDate":1215576904,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I wanted USVI for the same reasons as you and those are the only 2 AI I found as well.<br \/> <br \/> I quickly turned to Mexico because I love Mexico. We immediately applied for passports as well as our guests and we all got them in 1-2 weeks. Also, I planned our wedding in 6 months. Mexico has SO many great AI's , you may want to give it shot. <br \/> First, pick what area and then start emailing the resort to see what dates they have available. I just got married under 2 weeks ago at Dreams Tulum and it was perfect! Hope this helps.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>HIGH FIVE, WE'RE MARRIED!!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i51.photobucket.com\/albums\/f364\/pvtburks\/1-4.jpg\">http:\/\/i51.photobucket.com\/albums\/f364\/pvtburks\/1-4.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"monicalynn05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1194159725,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207901.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"monicabrandon2008","Id":207901,"Name":"monicabrandon2008","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7a5e3b8c437d3005086202b59f44462","RawContent":"if you search out USVI or St Thomas I am sure you will find the answers you are looking for. We have done most of the researching already.\n \n Happy hunting.","Attachments":[],"Id":373366,"PostDate":1215577559,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                if you search out USVI or St Thomas I am sure you will find the answers you are looking for. We have done most of the researching already.<br \/> <br \/> Happy hunting.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nurturedbynature312@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1173470820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207248.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LadyP","Id":207248,"Name":"LadyP","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5f685fde18358de586df93f1fa0f489","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;akittrell&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I think we are leaning more towards the USVI for our weddingmoon, but I&#039;m having a hard time finding many all inclusive resorts. So far, I&#039;ve found Bolongo Bay and Windham Bay Resort and that&#039;s it. I know there has to be more AI Resorts than these two.??&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Marriott Frenchman&#039;s Reef also offers all-inclusive. It&#039;s sort of hidden when you search for prices - it&#039;s called Escape! Inclusive. The package also offers unlimited ferry transfers to Downtown Charlotte Amalie - nice perk! (they cost $6pp\/way otherwise)\n \n We were down there in May and stayed at the Marriott for a couple of nights (we didn&#039;t do all-inclusive), so let me know if you have any questions on the property. It was gorgeous! Unbelievable views. We saw a couple of weddings, too - they looked beautiful.\n \n FWIW, one of the WCs for Marriott just moved in next door to my future in-laws on St Thomas...her name is April and they said she&#039;s really nice! Very ironic, since we were going to call her about Marriott weddings during our stay, but decided to hold our wedding at the in-laws instead...then she moves in next door 2 months later! Weird. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; Anyways, can&#039;t hurt to give her a call. Good luck!!","Attachments":[],"Id":373375,"PostDate":1215578000,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>akittrell<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I think we are leaning more towards the USVI for our weddingmoon, but I'm having a hard time finding many all inclusive resorts. So far, I've found Bolongo Bay and Windham Bay Resort and that's it. I know there has to be more AI Resorts than these two.??<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Marriott Frenchman's Reef also offers all-inclusive. It's sort of hidden when you search for prices - it's called Escape! Inclusive. The package also offers unlimited ferry transfers to Downtown Charlotte Amalie - nice perk! (they cost $6pp\/way otherwise)<br \/> <br \/> We were down there in May and stayed at the Marriott for a couple of nights (we didn't do all-inclusive), so let me know if you have any questions on the property. It was gorgeous! Unbelievable views. We saw a couple of weddings, too - they looked beautiful.<br \/> <br \/> FWIW, one of the WCs for Marriott just moved in next door to my future in-laws on St Thomas...her name is April and they said she's really nice! Very ironic, since we were going to call her about Marriott weddings during our stay, but decided to hold our wedding at the in-laws instead...then she moves in next door 2 months later! Weird. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> Anyways, can't hurt to give her a call. Good luck!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Anaiah<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"anaiahhass@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1213158409,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209883.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"futureeilen","Id":209883,"Name":"futureeilen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97bfabd974f239b71d7b9303257b0581","RawContent":"i love st. thomas but those are pretty much the only all-inclusives and they are pretty pricey when compared to mexico.","Attachments":[],"Id":373436,"PostDate":1215582956,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i love st. thomas but those are pretty much the only all-inclusives and they are pretty pricey when compared to mexico.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:10px;\"><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/48680\/mummergirl-s-totally-after-the-fact-planning-thread#post_963823\">My After-the-Fact Planning Thread<\/a><\/span>","Email":"mummergirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.83.34.78","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1207092360,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208981.jpg?_r=1389220347","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cougs","Id":208981,"Name":"cougs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17e9b7a1253affa45c76db7e1061b215","RawContent":"In the initial stages of my planning I peeked at the USVI and didn&#039;t find many all-inclusives either and what I did find was pricy for the length of time we wanted to stay. Good luck! Let us know what you find.","Attachments":[],"Id":373439,"PostDate":1215583523,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                In the initial stages of my planning I peeked at the USVI and didn't find many all-inclusives either and what I did find was pricy for the length of time we wanted to stay. Good luck! Let us know what you find.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>~Kelly<\/strong><br><br><strong>Our Awesome Wedding Pics:<\/strong><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/weddings\/kelly&ron\/\">http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/weddings\/kelly&ron\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kcoby@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1211261995,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209491.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KLC77","Id":209491,"Name":"KLC77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06679c3d0188012e7d3400bf276787ee","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;monicabrandon2008&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I wanted USVI for the same reasons as you and those are the only 2 AI I found as well.\n \n I quickly turned to Mexico because I love Mexico. We immediately applied for passports as well as our guests and we all got them in 1-2 weeks. Also, I planned our wedding in 6 months. Mexico has SO many great AI&#039;s , you may want to give it shot. \n First, pick what area and then start emailing the resort to see what dates they have available. I just got married under 2 weeks ago at Dreams Tulum and it was perfect! Hope this helps.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks for the advice Monica, and congrats on your wedding!\n \n Is it true that when you are married in Mexico your ceremony has to be performed in Spanish? I&#039;m getting mixed info on this. This is the main reason we haven&#8217;t looked at any of the resorts in Mexico. If it&#039;s not true then I&#8217;m going to start looking at the resorts there.\n \n It makes me feel better to know that you were able to plan a successful wedding within 6 months. We just got engaged two weeks ago, and we only have 6 months to do our planning. I&#039;m really starting to get anxious as I never would have thought we wouldn&#039;t have a location picked at this point.","Attachments":[],"Id":374034,"PostDate":1215628320,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>monicabrandon2008<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I wanted USVI for the same reasons as you and those are the only 2 AI I found as well.<br \/> <br \/> I quickly turned to Mexico because I love Mexico. We immediately applied for passports as well as our guests and we all got them in 1-2 weeks. Also, I planned our wedding in 6 months. Mexico has SO many great AI's , you may want to give it shot. <br \/> First, pick what area and then start emailing the resort to see what dates they have available. I just got married under 2 weeks ago at Dreams Tulum and it was perfect! Hope this helps.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks for the advice Monica, and congrats on your wedding!<br \/> <br \/> Is it true that when you are married in Mexico your ceremony has to be performed in Spanish? I'm getting mixed info on this. This is the main reason we haven&#8217;t looked at any of the resorts in Mexico. If it's not true then I&#8217;m going to start looking at the resorts there.<br \/> <br \/> It makes me feel better to know that you were able to plan a successful wedding within 6 months. We just got engaged two weeks ago, and we only have 6 months to do our planning. I'm really starting to get anxious as I never would have thought we wouldn't have a location picked at this point.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png\">http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wUBKFOA\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...FOA\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><span>The below website is a great tool! It's really helped me in my quest to lose weight and live a healthier life!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg\">http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"alkittrell2@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215206899,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210322.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akittrell","Id":210322,"Name":"akittrell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f87422c4a51abde6a2287022134b8591","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;LadyP&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;if you search out USVI or St Thomas I am sure you will find the answers you are looking for. We have done most of the researching already.\n \n Happy hunting.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Any particular search engine you are using? Google just hasn&#039;t been much help at all for me. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n Thanks for the help!","Attachments":[],"Id":374039,"PostDate":1215628419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>LadyP<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">if you search out USVI or St Thomas I am sure you will find the answers you are looking for. We have done most of the researching already.<br \/> <br \/> Happy hunting.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Any particular search engine you are using? Google just hasn't been much help at all for me. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Thanks for the help!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png\">http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wUBKFOA\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...FOA\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><span>The below website is a great tool! It's really helped me in my quest to lose weight and live a healthier life!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg\">http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"alkittrell2@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215206899,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210322.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akittrell","Id":210322,"Name":"akittrell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5cfd80fc48be16673b3718b236a96a0f","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;futureeilen&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Marriott Frenchman&#039;s Reef also offers all-inclusive. It&#039;s sort of hidden when you search for prices - it&#039;s called Escape! Inclusive. The package also offers unlimited ferry transfers to Downtown Charlotte Amalie - nice perk! (they cost $6pp\/way otherwise)\n \n We were down there in May and stayed at the Marriott for a couple of nights (we didn&#039;t do all-inclusive), so let me know if you have any questions on the property. It was gorgeous! Unbelievable views. We saw a couple of weddings, too - they looked beautiful.\n \n FWIW, one of the WCs for Marriott just moved in next door to my future in-laws on St Thomas...her name is April and they said she&#039;s really nice! Very ironic, since we were going to call her about Marriott weddings during our stay, but decided to hold our wedding at the in-laws instead...then she moves in next door 2 months later! Weird. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; Anyways, can&#039;t hurt to give her a call. Good luck!!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks for the info! I&#039;m going to check it out as well as some AI resorts in some other locations. The general consensus seems to be that the USVI is a little more pricey and not as many AI resort options. I&#039;ll PM you if I need her number once I&#039;ve finished checking it out. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":374048,"PostDate":1215628694,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>futureeilen<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Marriott Frenchman's Reef also offers all-inclusive. It's sort of hidden when you search for prices - it's called Escape! Inclusive. The package also offers unlimited ferry transfers to Downtown Charlotte Amalie - nice perk! (they cost $6pp\/way otherwise)<br \/> <br \/> We were down there in May and stayed at the Marriott for a couple of nights (we didn't do all-inclusive), so let me know if you have any questions on the property. It was gorgeous! Unbelievable views. We saw a couple of weddings, too - they looked beautiful.<br \/> <br \/> FWIW, one of the WCs for Marriott just moved in next door to my future in-laws on St Thomas...her name is April and they said she's really nice! Very ironic, since we were going to call her about Marriott weddings during our stay, but decided to hold our wedding at the in-laws instead...then she moves in next door 2 months later! Weird. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> Anyways, can't hurt to give her a call. Good luck!!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks for the info! I'm going to check it out as well as some AI resorts in some other locations. The general consensus seems to be that the USVI is a little more pricey and not as many AI resort options. I'll PM you if I need her number once I've finished checking it out. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png\">http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wUBKFOA\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...FOA\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><span>The below website is a great tool! It's really helped me in my quest to lose weight and live a healthier life!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg\">http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"alkittrell2@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215206899,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210322.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akittrell","Id":210322,"Name":"akittrell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d0d5af9822dee704834125b2586cf20","RawContent":"Thanks! I&#039;ll let you know what I find out and what we decide on!","Attachments":[],"Id":374056,"PostDate":1215629154,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n    