{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a51dbad9785ba31031e863748bc831b6","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;akittrell&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Thanks for the advice Monica, and congrats on your wedding!\n \n Is it true that when you are married in Mexico your ceremony has to be performed in Spanish? I&#039;m getting mixed info on this. This is the main reason we haven\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t looked at any of the resorts in Mexico. If it&#039;s not true then I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m going to start looking at the resorts there.\n \n It makes me feel better to know that you were able to plan a successful wedding within 6 months. We just got engaged two weeks ago, and we only have 6 months to do our planning. I&#039;m really starting to get anxious as I never would have thought we wouldn&#039;t have a location picked at this point.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n Thnk you :)\n \n Yes, if you get legally married it will be in spanish but someone will translate.\n We decided to get legally married here a few weeks before we went and had the symbolic ceremony in Mexico. Only a few guests knew that though. A lot of ladies on this forum do that because it is just easier and saves money.","Attachments":[],"Id":374235,"PostDate":1215632922,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>akittrell<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Thanks for the advice Monica, and congrats on your wedding!<br \/> <br \/> Is it true that when you are married in Mexico your ceremony has to be performed in Spanish? I'm getting mixed info on this. This is the main reason we haven\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t looked at any of the resorts in Mexico. If it's not true then I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m going to start looking at the resorts there.<br \/> <br \/> It makes me feel better to know that you were able to plan a successful wedding within 6 months. We just got engaged two weeks ago, and we only have 6 months to do our planning. I'm really starting to get anxious as I never would have thought we wouldn't have a location picked at this point.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> Thnk you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> Yes, if you get legally married it will be in spanish but someone will translate.<br \/> We decided to get legally married here a few weeks before we went and had the symbolic ceremony in Mexico. Only a few guests knew that though. A lot of ladies on this forum do that because it is just easier and saves money.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>HIGH FIVE, WE'RE MARRIED!!!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i51.photobucket.com\/albums\/f364\/pvtburks\/1-4.jpg\">http:\/\/i51.photobucket.com\/albums\/f364\/pvtburks\/1-4.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"monicalynn05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1194159725,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207901.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"monicabrandon2008","Id":207901,"Name":"monicabrandon2008","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a663f46297ddf0133c0fb9201b943787","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;akittrell&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Any particular search engine you are using? Google just hasn&#039;t been much help at all for me. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n Thanks for the help!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Catherine means the search feature on the board I believe. It&#039;s located on the top menu bar.","Attachments":[],"Id":374540,"PostDate":1215641493,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>akittrell<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Any particular search engine you are using? Google just hasn't been much help at all for me. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Thanks for the help!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Catherine means the search feature on the board I believe. It's located on the top menu bar.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ocasiojessica@aol.com","IpAddress":"72.82.169.76","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1174588020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207276.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jessica","Id":207276,"Name":"Jessica","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17cad6597447a398fd0bf681b3f48fd1","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;futureeilen&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Marriott Frenchman&#039;s Reef also offers all-inclusive.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I was going to suggest the Marriott too. It took us a few months to really decide on where to stay. We looked at Bolongo &amp;amp; the Marriott too. We decided on staying at the Wyndham, they have a decent deal right now. They are offering AI for 5days\/4nights, for 2 it&#039;s $1275. Not a bad deal, you just have to keep a look out. We chose the Wyndham for a lot of reasons but mainly b\/c we are staying on St Thomas but getting married on St John so the ferry ride will only be a 15-20 min ride. I&#039;ve heard great things about the Wyndham so that is always a plus!","Attachments":[],"Id":374893,"PostDate":1215657183,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>futureeilen<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Marriott Frenchman's Reef also offers all-inclusive.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I was going to suggest the Marriott too. It took us a few months to really decide on where to stay. We looked at Bolongo & the Marriott too. We decided on staying at the Wyndham, they have a decent deal right now. They are offering AI for 5days\/4nights, for 2 it's $1275. Not a bad deal, you just have to keep a look out. We chose the Wyndham for a lot of reasons but mainly b\/c we are staying on St Thomas but getting married on St John so the ferry ride will only be a 15-20 min ride. I've heard great things about the Wyndham so that is always a plus!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yvemarie_e@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1203980267,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208649.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Yvette","Id":208649,"Name":"Yvette","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e226a3422787f9432ee7703de18220b","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;akittrell&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Thanks for the advice Monica, and congrats on your wedding!\n \n Is it true that when you are married in Mexico your ceremony has to be performed in Spanish? I&#039;m getting mixed info on this. This is the main reason we haven\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t looked at any of the resorts in Mexico. If it&#039;s not true then I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m going to start looking at the resorts there.\n \n It makes me feel better to know that you were able to plan a successful wedding within 6 months. We just got engaged two weeks ago, and we only have 6 months to do our planning. I&#039;m really starting to get anxious as I never would have thought we wouldn&#039;t have a location picked at this point.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Legal ceremonies have to be performed in Spanish with a judge, someone usually translates. Symbolic ceremonies can be in English.","Attachments":[],"Id":375015,"PostDate":1215662187,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>akittrell<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Thanks for the advice Monica, and congrats on your wedding!<br \/> <br \/> Is it true that when you are married in Mexico your ceremony has to be performed in Spanish? I'm getting mixed info on this. This is the main reason we haven\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t looked at any of the resorts in Mexico. If it's not true then I\u00e2\u20ac\u2122m going to start looking at the resorts there.<br \/> <br \/> It makes me feel better to know that you were able to plan a successful wedding within 6 months. We just got engaged two weeks ago, and we only have 6 months to do our planning. I'm really starting to get anxious as I never would have thought we wouldn't have a location picked at this point.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Legal ceremonies have to be performed in Spanish with a judge, someone usually translates. Symbolic ceremonies can be in English.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>19 adults\/3 children with flights booked! 10 rooms booked!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/BM2Hm4\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/BM2Hm4\/.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dpabride.blogspot.com\/\">http:\/\/dpabride.blogspot.com\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kinkaid.rios@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1214412960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210154.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bianca","Id":210154,"Name":"Bianca","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"781cbbb5919baa8c981b633cb47211a2","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Yvette&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I was going to suggest the Marriott too. It took us a few months to really decide on where to stay. We looked at Bolongo &amp;amp; the Marriott too. We decided on staying at the Wyndham, they have a decent deal right now. They are offering AI for 5days\/4nights, for 2 it&#039;s $1275. Not a bad deal, you just have to keep a look out. We chose the Wyndham for a lot of reasons but mainly b\/c we are staying on St Thomas but getting married on St John so the ferry ride will only be a 15-20 min ride. I&#039;ve heard great things about the Wyndham so that is always a plus!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Bianca&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Legal ceremonies have to be performed in Spanish with a judge, someone usually translates. Symbolic ceremonies can be in English.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks Yvette for the info! That is a pretty sweet deal! I&#039;ll keep that in mind!\n \n Bianca thanks for clearing that up for me!\n \n I contacted TA Dina through the forum Tues. night and I spoke to her in more detail Wed. She seemed super nice and knowledgable! Y&#039;all keep your fingers crossed for me that she&#039;ll be able to help us pick a location!","Attachments":[],"Id":376763,"PostDate":1215779898,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Yvette<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I was going to suggest the Marriott too. It took us a few months to really decide on where to stay. We looked at Bolongo & the Marriott too. We decided on staying at the Wyndham, they have a decent deal right now. They are offering AI for 5days\/4nights, for 2 it's $1275. Not a bad deal, you just have to keep a look out. We chose the Wyndham for a lot of reasons but mainly b\/c we are staying on St Thomas but getting married on St John so the ferry ride will only be a 15-20 min ride. I've heard great things about the Wyndham so that is always a plus!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Bianca<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Legal ceremonies have to be performed in Spanish with a judge, someone usually translates. Symbolic ceremonies can be in English.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks Yvette for the info! That is a pretty sweet deal! I'll keep that in mind!<br \/> <br \/> Bianca thanks for clearing that up for me!<br \/> <br \/> I contacted TA Dina through the forum Tues. night and I spoke to her in more detail Wed. She seemed super nice and knowledgable! Y'all keep your fingers crossed for me that she'll be able to help us pick a location!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png\">http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wUBKFOA\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...FOA\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><span>The below website is a great tool! It's really helped me in my quest to lose weight and live a healthier life!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg\">http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"alkittrell2@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215206899,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210322.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akittrell","Id":210322,"Name":"akittrell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ed1fa88e5118791f78cb82fa2331bf5","RawContent":"glad i could help! good luck on choosing your location. i&#039;m sure whatever you pick will be perfect!","Attachments":[],"Id":377327,"PostDate":1215798428,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                glad i could help! good luck on choosing your location. i'm sure whatever you pick will be perfect!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yvemarie_e@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1203980267,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208649.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Yvette","Id":208649,"Name":"Yvette","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"621ffa0be202e1b4e79cf78aff09c25d","RawContent":"Akittrell,\n \n I am a St. Thomas Bride getting married at the Wyndham.. if you have any questions you can PM me :)","Attachments":[],"Id":379906,"PostDate":1216048403,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Akittrell,<br \/> <br \/> I am a St. Thomas Bride getting married at the Wyndham.. if you have any questions you can PM me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>Jen<\/strong><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10748;116\/st\/20090612\/e\/Our+Wedding+in+St.+Thomas\/k\/1146\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...1146\/event.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.scottandjenwedding.com\">www.scottandjenwedding.com<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jennifernbenner@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1214929180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210260.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"09bride","Id":210260,"Name":"09bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8afe62437c453930d74f640d1bea22f8","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;09bride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Akittrell,\n \n I am a St. Thomas Bride getting married at the Wyndham.. if you have any questions you can PM me :)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks I really appreciate it!","Attachments":[],"Id":380180,"PostDate":1216058416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>09bride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Akittrell,<br \/> <br \/> I am a St. Thomas Bride getting married at the Wyndham.. if you have any questions you can PM me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks I really appreciate it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png\">http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wUBKFOA\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...FOA\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><span>The below website is a great tool! It's really helped me in my quest to lose weight and live a healthier life!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg\">http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"alkittrell2@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215206899,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210322.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akittrell","Id":210322,"Name":"akittrell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08206b05aa364c0c35e15f99198cba2b","RawContent":"akittrell,\n Tho I realize you are interested in all inclusive, you may want to consider other alternatives as the hotel route seems to be more expensive over all. You have lots of options in STT! You may even want to consider a villa and have your private wedding right there! Ck out: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.mclaughlinanderson.com\"&gt;Caribbean Villas: Caribbean Villa Rentals by McLaughlin Anderson Villas Virgin Islands&lt;\/a&gt; Plenty of villas to choose from! How many people guests do you expect for your wedding? This number can also play a roll in your planning!\n Good Luck in your search!\n BTW, I have worked with April prior to her going to Frenchman&#039;s Reef! She is a very nice person! A wonderful friend.....\n Hope you don&#039;t mind my input!","Attachments":[],"Id":385526,"PostDate":1216386656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                akittrell,<br \/> Tho I realize you are interested in all inclusive, you may want to consider other alternatives as the hotel route seems to be more expensive over all. You have lots of options in STT! You may even want to consider a villa and have your private wedding right there! Ck out: <a href='http:\/\/www.mclaughlinanderson.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Caribbean Villas: Caribbean Villa Rentals by McLaughlin Anderson Villas Virgin Islands<\/a> Plenty of villas to choose from! How many people guests do you expect for your wedding? This number can also play a roll in your planning!<br \/> Good Luck in your search!<br \/> BTW, I have worked with April prior to her going to Frenchman's Reef! She is a very nice person! A wonderful friend.....<br \/> Hope you don't mind my input!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/farm3.static.flickr.com\/2267\/2363959710_058a8dc807_m.jpg\">http:\/\/farm3.static.flickr.com\/2267\/...8a8dc807_m.jpg<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingstheislandway.com\">www.weddingstheislandway.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mclaughlinanderson.com\">www.mclaughlinanderson.com<\/a><br><span>Stone Cottage and Rockworks VillasSt. Thomas, US Virgin Islands<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sherriloumerritt@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1203214672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208563.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sherri","Id":208563,"Name":"sherri","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":19683,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a96e5b8d00c9bc6f51f936539ef17ee7","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;sherri&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;akittrell,\n Tho I realize you are interested in all inclusive, you may want to consider other alternatives as the hotel route seems to be more expensive over all. You have lots of options in STT! You may even want to consider a villa and have your private wedding right there! Ck out: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.mclaughlinanderson.com\"&gt;Caribbean Villas: Caribbean Villa Rentals by McLaughlin Anderson Villas Virgin Islands&lt;\/a&gt; Plenty of villas to choose from! How many people guests do you expect for your wedding? This number can also play a roll in your planning!\n Good Luck in your search!\n BTW, I have worked with April prior to her going to Frenchman&#039;s Reef! She is a very nice person! A wonderful friend.....\n Hope you don&#039;t mind my input!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks for the advise, but as of yesterday we&#039;ve decided to go with Jamaica. We are trying to book Sandals Whitehouse today! The AI option just seems to be the best and easiest way for us to go. Thanks again!","Attachments":[],"Id":385731,"PostDate":1216397040,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>sherri<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">akittrell,<br \/> Tho I realize you are interested in all inclusive, you may want to consider other alternatives as the hotel route seems to be more expensive over all. You have lots of options in STT! You may even want to consider a villa and have your private wedding right there! Ck out: <a href='http:\/\/www.mclaughlinanderson.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Caribbean Villas: Caribbean Villa Rentals by McLaughlin Anderson Villas Virgin Islands<\/a> Plenty of villas to choose from! How many people guests do you expect for your wedding? This number can also play a roll in your planning!<br \/> Good Luck in your search!<br \/> BTW, I have worked with April prior to her going to Frenchman's Reef! She is a very nice person! A wonderful friend.....<br \/> Hope you don't mind my input!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks for the advise, but as of yesterday we've decided to go with Jamaica. We are trying to book Sandals Whitehouse today! The AI option just seems to be the best and easiest way for us to go. Thanks again!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png\">http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/cache\/ac28bc59fb.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wUBKFOA\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...FOA\/weight.png<\/a><br><br><span>The below website is a great tool! It's really helped me in my quest to lose weight and live a healthier life!<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg\">http:\/\/img.thedailyplate.com\/images\/promos\/promo_01.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"alkittrell2@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1215206899,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210322.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":77,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akittrell","Id":210322,"Name":"akittrell","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":23,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
